<title>USA: Emery gets two-year freight pact extension.</title>
<headline>Emery gets two-year freight pact extension.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, California 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Express freight carrier Emery Worldwide said it has received a two-year renewal of its contract to act as primary carrier of domestic heavyweight freight for Anixter, Inc.</p>
<p>Anixter is a $2.5 billion provider of integrated networking and cabling systems. The contract calls for Emery to move freight from six Anixter hubs to customers throughout the U.S. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
